{"id":"9951d1dd53a3ed60","group":"89","path":"89/89-df-modal-characters.md","title":"Finite Modal Characters","display":"df-modal-characters — Finite Modal Characters","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-df-modal-characters","aliases":["89-df-modal-characters"],"created":"2026-10-05","display":"df-modal-characters — Finite Modal Characters","depends_on":["[[89-df-modal-degree]]","[[89-df-modal-sequent]]","[[89-df-diamond-modality]]","[[89-df-modal-godel-code]]"],"revised":"2026-10-09"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-df-modal-characters"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-df-modal-characters</span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"display","html":"df-modal-characters — Finite Modal Characters"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"04ea1c6ff126f884\" href=\"?note=04ea1c6ff126f884\" title=\"89-df-modal-degree\">89-df-modal-degree</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"ca21b68a25f1afc2\" href=\"?note=ca21b68a25f1afc2\" title=\"89-df-modal-sequent\">89-df-modal-sequent</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0e77586c4dc7e03a\" href=\"?note=0e77586c4dc7e03a\" title=\"89-df-diamond-modality\">89-df-diamond-modality</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"ff66b5cf43748aff\" href=\"?note=ff66b5cf43748aff\" title=\"89-df-modal-godel-code\">89-df-modal-godel-code</a></span></div>"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-09"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q=\\langle q_0,\\ldots,q_{s-1}\\rangle\">\\(Q=\\langle q_0,\\ldots,q_{s-1}\\rangle\\)</span> 为互异命题字母的有限有序列，允许 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"s=0\">\\(s=0\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>用固定的可计算有限树编码对有限公式集合升序枚举；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\bigwedge\">\\(\\bigwedge\\)</span> 是已有有序折叠。</li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\lambda_b(C)\">\\(\\lambda_b(C)\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)\">\\(\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)\\)</span> 为下文引入的符号；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"b\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(b\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\\in\\omega\">\\(m\\in\\omega\\)</span>。</li>\n<li>本条的有限公式排序使用 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"ff66b5cf43748aff\" href=\"?note=ff66b5cf43748aff\" title=\"89-df-modal-godel-code\">89-df-modal-godel-code</a> 的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{sort}\">\\(\\operatorname{sort}\\)</span>；其他有限指标序列仍按已声明的自然数顺序。</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}characters}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\lambda_b(C)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}C,&amp;b=1,\\\\\\neg C,&amp;b=0,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{Char}_Q(0)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\bigwedge\\langle\\lambda_{a_i}(q_i):i&lt;s\\rangle\\mid a:s\\to\\{0,1\\}\\},\\\\\nE_Q(m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sort}(\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\bigwedge(\\langle\\lambda_{a_i}(q_i):i&lt;s\\rangle{}^\\frown\n\\langle\\lambda_{d_j}(\\Diamond E_Q(m)_j):j&lt;|E_Q(m)|\\rangle)\n\\mid a:s\\to\\{0,1\\},\\ d:|E_Q(m)|\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}characters}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\lambda_b(C)&amp;\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}C,&amp;b=1,\\\\\\neg C,&amp;b=0,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{Char}_Q(0)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\bigwedge\\langle\\lambda_{a_i}(q_i):i&lt;s\\rangle\\mid a:s\\to\\{0,1\\}\\},\\\\\nE_Q(m)&amp;\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sort}(\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m+1)&amp;\\coloneqq\n\\{\\bigwedge(\\langle\\lambda_{a_i}(q_i):i&lt;s\\rangle{}^\\frown\n\\langle\\lambda_{d_j}(\\Diamond E_Q(m)_j):j&lt;|E_Q(m)|\\rangle)\n\\mid a:s\\to\\{0,1\\},\\ d:|E_Q(m)|\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，印刷页 114；对应 PDF 页为印刷页加 39。</p>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E_Q(m)\">\\(E_Q(m)\\)</span> 是递归第 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"m\">\\(m\\)</span> 层的唯一有限有序枚举；sort 以固定语法编码为序。初始集合有限；每一步有限比特串生成有限公式集，因此自然数递归存在唯一。空 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"Q\">\\(Q\\)</span> 的零阶 character 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\top\">\\(\\top\\)</span>。保留所有比特选择，包括 GL 不一致的 characters；不能预先删掉它们后还声称相同递归计数。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-modal-degree","status":"resolved","id":"04ea1c6ff126f884","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-degree]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-sequent","status":"resolved","id":"ca21b68a25f1afc2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-sequent]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-diamond-modality","status":"resolved","id":"0e77586c4dc7e03a","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-diamond-modality]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-godel-code","status":"resolved","id":"ff66b5cf43748aff","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-godel-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-modal-godel-code","status":"resolved","id":"ff66b5cf43748aff","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"本条的有限公式排序使用 [[89-df-modal-godel-code]] 的 $\\operatorname{sort}$；其他有限指标序列仍按已声明的自然数顺序。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"Q=\\langle q_0,\\ldots,q_{s-1}\\rangle","display":false},{"tex":"s=0","display":false},{"tex":"\\bigwedge","display":false},{"tex":"\\lambda_b(C)","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)","display":false},{"tex":"b\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"m\\in\\omega","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{sort}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}modal\\text{-}characters}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\n\\lambda_b(C)&\\coloneqq\\begin{cases}C,&b=1,\\\\\\neg C,&b=0,\\end{cases}\\\\\n\\mathrm{Char}_Q(0)&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\bigwedge\\langle\\lambda_{a_i}(q_i):i<s\\rangle\\mid a:s\\to\\{0,1\\}\\},\\\\\nE_Q(m)&\\coloneqq\\operatorname{sort}(\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m)),\\\\\n\\mathrm{Char}_Q(m+1)&\\coloneqq\n\\{\\bigwedge(\\langle\\lambda_{a_i}(q_i):i<s\\rangle{}^\\frown\n\\langle\\lambda_{d_j}(\\Diamond E_Q(m)_j):j<|E_Q(m)|\\rangle)\n\\mid a:s\\to\\{0,1\\},\\ d:|E_Q(m)|\\to\\{0,1\\}\\}.\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"E_Q(m)","display":false},{"tex":"m","display":false},{"tex":"Q","display":false},{"tex":"\\top","display":false}],"bytes":1897,"backlinks":[{"id":"6d8c3016a32d17f8","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"9fe494d9579129b3","anchor":"ref-1","locations":["元数据 · depends_on"],"count":1,"excerpt":""},{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-109","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-modal-characters]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-108","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"一般有限构造：[[89-df-modal-degree]] → [[89-df-modal-characters]] → [[89-lem-modal-character-partition]] → [[89-lem-fixed-point-character-bound]] → [[89-df-fixed-point-algorithm]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-degree-bound]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-theorem]] → [[89-thm-fixed-point-characterization]]。"}],"outgoing":["04ea1c6ff126f884","ca21b68a25f1afc2","0e77586c4dc7e03a","ff66b5cf43748aff"]}